[DrvInst]
DrvInst=Gestetner MP 402SPF PCL 6,infotec MP 402SPF PCL 6,LANIER MP 402SPF PCL 6,NRG MP 402SPF PCL 6,RICOH MP 402SPF PCL 6,SAVIN MP 402SPF PCL 6
